  artifactName: Traditional Inabel Woven Textile
  artifactSprite: {fileID: 1385368996570982847, guid: 8cf13670a8683a8478eb7a8e00f8b1fb, type: 3}
  plaqueTitle: ...
  plaqueDescription: A finely loomed traditional woven textile crafted using heritage
    indigenous backstrap looms, featuring sacred geometric patterns from northern
    Luzon.
  artifactInspectionDescription: Tightly spun natural cotton threads with fringed
    tassels along the hem. The interlocking geometric motifs symbolize rice paddies,
    ancestral waves, and protective clan seals.
